{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":7},"Humilitas","Vous vivez sur un territoire magnifique fait de collines verdoyantes. Ces Monts et Coteaux, territoires d'élevage du Rhône, ont été façonnés par des générations de paysans. Ils sont environ 1 500 sur le département ; les connaissez-vous vraiment ? Avez-vous une vision objective de la réalité de leur vie ? Que ressent-ils au plus profond d'eux, dans une profession qui évolue si vite, au milieu d'une société qui évolue si profondément ? Avec leurs mots et leur coeur, ils vous invitent à découvrir la complexité de leur métier.",[4,5,6],"self-employment","rural","disappearing professions",{"type":8,"id":9,"slug":10,"title":11,"release":13,"filmType":17,"directors":18,"genre":34,"media":37,"synopsis":39,"production":40,"characters":43,"roles":44,"awards":55,"tags":3},"Film","FR2020_096","fr2020-096-humilitas",{"native":1,"english":12},"",{"type":14,"date":15,"year":16},"Theatrical release",null,0,"Documentary",[19,25,30],{"id":20,"slug":21,"name":20,"birthYear":16,"deathYear":16,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":24},"Gilles Murigneux","gilles-murigneux","Male identifying","France",[],{"id":26,"slug":27,"name":26,"birthYear":16,"deathYear":16,"gender":28,"nationality":23,"awards":29},"Valérie Bochard","valerie-bochard","Female identifying",[],{"id":31,"slug":32,"name":31,"birthYear":16,"deathYear":16,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":33},"Jean-Claude Guillaume","jean-claude-guillaume",[],[35,36],"Documentary – Participatory mode","Documentary – Observational mode",{"posterUrl":38,"trailerUrl":12},"https://www.frgdsaura.fr/assets/uploads/GDS69/Rh%C3%B4ne%20Info/Humilitas.jpg?1593525489580",{"native":2,"english":12},[41],{"country":23,"share":42},"Majority coproducer",[],[45,49,52],{"person":46,"role":48},{"id":20,"slug":21,"name":20,"birthYear":16,"deathYear":16,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":47},[],"Director of the film",{"person":50,"role":48},{"id":3